# Home Assistant long-lived access token (Profile -> Security ->
# Long-lived access tokens -> Create Token) for the /api/prometheus
# scrape (ServiceMonitor in exporters/home-assistant.yaml).
# Copy to homeassistant.env and fill in; the kustomize secretGenerator
# turns this into the Secret `homeassistant-token` in namespace `home`.
HASS_PROMETHEUS_TOKEN=change-me-create-in-ha-ui
